  " \[LineSeparator]",
  "SpectralNDSolveValue[eq, u, {x, y} ∈ Ω, n, opts] gives the value of the solution of eq as a pure function, with the same arguments, options and semantics as SpectralNDSolve."
}]]}}]], "Usage", CellID->982511436]
